  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Eye tracking for avatars has been recently broken In the latest patch 2018.4.4p6, build 693.\n-\nConfirmed in full body HTC vive trackers and without, in desktop, in several worlds with mirrors(including Avatar Testing), in the VR camera, with the help of my test account on a secondary PC, and with the help of other players/friends who had the very same problem.\nPersonal, public and default avatars are all affected.\n-\nUpdate:\nEye tracking does work in the Open Beta.",
